</b>。请按流程操作。注册在<a target="_blank" href="https://www.pexels.com/join-consumer/">此处</a>。应用创建和 <a target="_blank" href="https://www.pexels.com/api/new/">API Id 在此页面</a>。','Chinese (Taiwan)'=>'中文（台湾）','Resolution'=>'分辨率','Small (4MP)'=>'小 (4MP)','Medium (12MP)'=>'中 (12MP)','Large (24MP)'=>'大 (24MP)','Minimum photo size'=>'最小照片尺寸','From now on, <b>it\'s required</b> to provide your own <b>username</b> and <b>api key</b>. You can register in Pixabay website <a target="_blank" href="https://pixabay.com/en/accounts/register/">here</a> and get api username/key <a target="_blank" href="https://pixabay.com/api/docs/">here</a>'=>'从现在起，<b>必须</b>提供您自己的 <b>username</b> 和 <b>api key</b>。您可以在 Pixabay 网站<a target="_blank" href="https://pixabay.com/en/accounts/register/">此处</a>注册，并在<a target="_blank" href="https://pixabay.com/api/docs/">此处</a>获取 api 用户名/密钥','Pixabay username'=>'Pixabay 用户名','Api key'=>'Api key','Vector image'=>'矢量图像','Horizontal'=>'水平','Vertical'=>'垂直','Minimum width'=>'最小宽度','px minimum for width'=>'宽度最小 px','Minimum height'=>'最小高度','px minimum for height'=>'高度最小 px','Safesearch'=>'安全搜索','<b>It\'s required</b> to provide your own <b>api key</b>. You can register in Stability AI website <a target="_blank" href="https://platform.stability.ai/account/keys">here</a> and get api key.'=>'<b>必须</b>提供您自己的 <b>api key</b>。您可以在 Stability AI 网站<a target="_blank" href="https://platform.stability.ai/account/keys">此处</a>注册并获取 api key。','<b>Caution: Stable Diffusion API can take a long time</b> to generate. From 4 to 9 seconds to get an image. Generation is <b>faster with SD3.5 Large Turbo</b>.'=>'<b>注意：Stable Diffusion API 生成可能需要较长时间</b>。获取图像需要 4 到 9 秒。使用 <b>SD3.5 Large Turbo 生成更快</b>。','Model'=>'模型','Stable Diffusion 3.5 Large'=>'Stable Diffusion 3.5 Large','Stable Diffusion 3.5 Large Turbo'=>'Stable Diffusion 3.5 Large Turbo','Stable Diffusion 3.5 Medium'=>'Stable Diffusion 3.5 Medium','16:9'=>'16:9','1:1'=>'1:1','21:9'=>'21:9','2:3'=>'2:3','4:5'=>'4:5','5:4'=>'5:4','9:16'=>'9:16