se no image can be generated.'=>'未选择图库。请在下方至少添加一个图库，否则无法生成图像。','Configure'=>'配置','Configure %s'=>'配置 %s','Gutenberg block (manual search)'=>'Gutenberg 区块（手动搜索）','Banks shown as tabs when you search images from the Gutenberg block.'=>'从 Gutenberg 区块搜索图像时，图库将显示为选项卡。','API keys, sizes and filters are configured in %s.'=>'API 密钥、尺寸和筛选器在 %s 中配置。','This list is the fallback chain used by every automatic generation (editor button, bulk, cron, imports). Drag to set priority. Gutenberg search banks are chosen on the Gutenberg Block page.'=>'此列表是所有自动生成（编辑器按钮、批量、cron、导入）使用的后备链。拖动以设置优先级。Gutenberg 搜索图库在 Gutenberg 区块页面上选择。','Preview a search'=>'预览搜索','Test this bank without creating an image on a post. Uses the last saved API key and filters.'=>'测试此图库而不在文章上创建图像。使用上次保存的 API 密钥和筛选器。','Preview'=>'预览','Select a bank on the left to edit its API key, size, language and filters.'=>'在左侧选择图库以编辑其 API 密钥、尺寸、语言和筛选器。','Photos'=>'照片','AI'=>'AI','Ready'=>'就绪','No key'=>'无密钥','Untested'=>'未测试','Key OK'=>'密钥正常','Key failed'=>'密钥失败','Your configuration'=>'您的配置','Automatic bank chain'=>'自动图库链','Image placement'=>'图像位置','API keys'=>'API 密钥','Test configuration'=>'测试配置','Loading preview…'=>'正在加载预览…','Could not load a preview for this bank.'=>'无法加载此图库的预览。','No images returned for this keyword.'=>'此关键词未返回图像。','The first bank in the chain is a generative AI service. Preview would consume credits — generate on a post instead, or put a photo bank first.'=>'链中的第一个图库是生成式 AI 服务。预览会消耗额度 — 请改为在文章上生成，或将照片图库放在首位。','This bank (%s) is a generative AI service. Preview will consume tokens.'=>'此图库（%s）是生成式 AI 服务。预览将消耗令牌。','Generating with AI, this can take up to 40 seconds…'=>'正在使用 AI 生成，最多可能需要 40 秒…','This preview will call a generative AI service and consume tokens. Continue?'=>'此预览将调用生成式 AI 服务并消耗令牌。是否继续？','Chain not saved yet. Generation on posts still uses the last saved chain until you click Save.'=>'链尚未保存。在您点击保存之前，文章上的生成仍使用上次保存的链。','Unsaved changes'=>'未保存的更改','You have unsaved settings. Save them before leaving 